        return: 99
        catch: implements ()
            return: read_ref_q()
    ---
end: ref_formal_refused
fn: ref_null_read () int
    ---
        return: RefHolder\p\q
        catch: interpreter ()
            return: 55
    ---
end: ref_null_read
